// Q-161 A route that gives a database's error sends the visitor its text: the SQL, the table and the column, on any server, not only under --watch
// mode: serve
// get: /users
// open-when: {"error":"db: no such column
// fixed-when: internal error
// From FEEDBACK20.md §Q-161 (found on 9e8c2fb).

db.open(":memory:")
db.exec("create table if not exists users (id integer primary key, email text)")

route GET /users = db.query("select nope from users")
